<details>
<summary>Development</summary>

**Layout**

```
src/
  cli/commands/   # CLI handlers
  core/           # plugin business logic
  contracts/      # public plugin types
  manifest.ts     # plugin manifest
```

**Getting started**

```bash
pnpm install
pnpm build
pnpm kb <%= it.name %> hello
```

**What to edit**

- Business logic: `src/core/hello.ts`
- CLI commands: `src/cli/commands/hello.ts`
- Shared types: `src/contracts/index.ts`

**Link into the project**

```bash
cd ../../..
kb marketplace plugins add --link .kb/plugins/<%= it.name %>
```

**Health check**

```bash
pnpm kb scaffold doctor --path .
```

</details>
